      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.79 (up from ₹2.19 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹7.15b (up 68% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.60b (up ₹1.99b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 22% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 4.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 8.1%. Revenue is forecast to grow 26% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Software industry in India.",
