      "body": "BlackBuck Limited announced that Ms. Shilpi Pandey, Chief People Officer, a Senior Management Personnel as per Regulation 16(1)(d) of Listing Regulations of the Company, has tendered her resignation due to her personal commitments and to pursue other interests outside the Organization. The Company acknowledged the resignation and confirmed that Ms. Pandey will be relieved from her duties with effect from the close of business hours on January 20, 2026. Ms. Pandey cited personal commitments and the pursuit of other interests as reasons for her resignation. Effective date of cessation is January 20, 2026.",
